// Character creation and every dual-class give a hobgoblin the human's figure: the engine has no
// animation of the race. A party member of race HOBGOBLIN with a character animation (the check
// needs EEex, M_CBPRRC.lua) gets the hobgoblin's look and the race's spell effects (HGPCRACE).
IF
  Race(Player1,HOBGOBLIN)
  !StateCheck(Player1,STATE_REALLY_DEAD)
  EEex_LuaTrigger("return CBPR_HasCharacterAnimation(0)")
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    ApplySpellRES("HGPCRACE",Player1)
    Continue()
END

