// A protagonist made a hobgoblin in a game of a version before 0.3 (marker state, race HOBGOBLIN):
// HGPCRACE once, which takes away that version's effects for thief skills and infravision (the
// race tables give these now) and adds hatred of elves. A hobgoblin of this version matches once
// too; HGPCRACE then only replaces its own effects.
IF
  Global("CBPR_HOBGOBLIN_RACE","GLOBAL",0)
  Race(Player1,HOBGOBLIN)
  CheckSpellState(Player1,%hg_splstate%)
  !StateCheck(Player1,STATE_REALLY_DEAD)
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    SetGlobal("CBPR_HOBGOBLIN_RACE","GLOBAL",1)
    ApplySpellRES("HGPCRACE",Player1)
    Continue()
END
